                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5333a025-ef8a-3803-9429-fe6eec71b6a8",
                        "entry_id": "88d33867-a071-30a6-af32-49b447b6ae3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "муз. механический прибор для определения темпа произведения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f04fa97e-64ad-4e4f-b6ba-bc7691042f90",
                                "sense_id": "5333a025-ef8a-3803-9429-fe6eec71b6a8",
                                "text": "Занятия по ритмике с Владимиром Сергеевичем по-прежнему проходили в Онегинском зале под метроном и под рояль."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a978b15d-1b65-4abd-acbb-0247661a43a3",
                                "sense_id": "5333a025-ef8a-3803-9429-fe6eec71b6a8",
                                "text": "В углу ритмично, хоть проверяй метрономом, икал ювелир."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "705039c0-33be-44c4-b32a-f23774b37b20",
                        "source_entry_id": "88d33867-a071-30a6-af32-49b447b6ae3f",
                        "source_sense_id": "5333a025-ef8a-3803-9429-fe6eec71b6a8",
                        "target_lang_word": "metronome",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "metronome",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea0cc22d-d059-3209-b616-1d5a9f12294d",
                                        "entry_id": "7ec8d223-95c8-3d4e-82eb-79e2a8876b73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device, containing an inverted pendulum, used to mark time by means of regular ticks at adjustable intervals; an electronic equivalent that emits flashes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d11dab9f-9b4a-4867-b133-a343e924be55",
                                                "sense_id": "ea0cc22d-d059-3209-b616-1d5a9f12294d",
                                                "text": "The etudes with metronome markings should be played in tempo, all others should be considered rubato."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddbf324d-07dd-42dc-9bd9-598213bf3798",
                                                "sense_id": "ea0cc22d-d059-3209-b616-1d5a9f12294d",
                                                "text": "It’s one of the earliest pieces in the comprehensive collection of metronomes by the British instrument dealer Tony Bingham, which forms the bulk of the Basel exhibition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0664d92a-f94f-4e89-8a3a-1d50d51b050c",
                        "source_entry_id": "88d33867-a071-30a6-af32-49b447b6ae3f",
                        "source_sense_id": "5333a025-ef8a-3803-9429-fe6eec71b6a8",
                        "target_lang_word": "metrónomo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "metrónomo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f3de840-ea7d-3ee0-90f4-71b4a1aef1fa",
                                        "entry_id": "92965177-6e1e-3235-ae12-8e5e55415c95",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Máquina, a manera de reloj, para medir el tiempo e indicar el compás de las composiciones musicales. El sonido del péndulo que oscila en el metrónomo cuando se le pone en movimiento, señala exactamente la rapidez o lentitud que corresponde al aire de las piezas que se ejecutan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "instrumentos de medida"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
